  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Tropical Timber Organization (ITTO): Voluntary Project Contribution (Indonesia and developing countries)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary co-contribution towards two ITTO Projects: 1) $153,350 to improve the governance and management of the UNESCO biosphere under the &apos;Enhancing the Implementation of Landscape Mangement of Giam Siak Kecil-Bukit Batu Biosphere Reserve in Riau Province of Sumatra island, Indonesia&apos; project; and 2) $6,650 to the ITTO Fellowship Programme, which strengthens professional expertise in tropical forestry in ITTO member countries by providing opportunities to young and mid-career forests professionals from developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
